Problem Statement
Implement a program to calculate the factorial of a given number.

Ans:
class Tester {
	public static void main(String[] args) {
	    int n=5;
	    int fact=1;
	    for(int i=1;i<=n;i++)
	    {
	        fact=fact*i;
	    }
	    System.out.println(fact);
	    
	}
	
}

Problem Statement

